{
  "about": "What a screen reader gets from the counter example on Windows: the UI Automation roles, names and states scripts/windows-a11y.sh checks (scripts/windows/a11y-check.py). The app runs in English (PRISM_LOCALE=en-US). Names are Prism's; WinUI's own words (localized types) depend on the machine's language and are left out.",
